    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0472","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Malak Jovanović talks about the shadow of a canvas that was never painted. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
